// Dialog :
"P1134574162" "{PERSON_NAME} said those organs were the remains of fallen heroes. It seems that through doctors like {TRAITOR_NAME}, Vahzilok has a pipeline to the hopsitals, which he's using to siphon off the best donated organs for his own dark purposes. The way {TRAITOR_NAME} described Dr. Vahzilok's experiments, they seem nothing sort of brilliant. If only he would confine himself to legal experiments, his brilliance could be a great boon to mankind."

