"P1744983174" "The neighborhood watch in Steel Canyon is reporting a serious problem with the Vahzilok. The zombies have been breaking into labs and making off with all the medical equipment. Sometimes they even take a technician! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to get to Steel Canyon and stop the Vahzilok lab raids.</A> I don't know what the Vahzilok plan to do with that equipment, but it can only mean more tragedy for Paragon City."
